    <div class="bg-bg-card border border-red-500/30 rounded-xl p-5 md:p-8 fade-in">
      <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm mb-3">The IRGC closed the Strait of Hormuz — the narrow waterway through which roughly <strong class="text-white">20% of the world's oil supply</strong> passes daily. This is one of Iran's most significant escalation levers.</p>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">A closure disrupts global energy markets, drives oil prices up, and directly impacts economies worldwide. This had long been considered Iran's "nuclear option" in economic terms.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

