      <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm mb-3">An airstrike hit a girls' elementary school in <strong class="text-white">Minab</strong>, Iran. The incident drew widespread international condemnation. According to the Iranian Red Crescent Society, at least 110 of the 201 confirmed killed were civilians.</p>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">The human rights group HRANA separately reported 133 killed and at least 200 injured. Casualty figures remained contested between Iranian government, Iranian civil society, and Western sources.</p>
